<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #111">
    <p>Hello,</p>
    <p>
      Your draft application <strong>{{applicationCode}}</strong>{{#if organizationName}} for
      <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong>{{/if}} on <strong>{{appName}}</strong> was saved at
      {{savedAt}}. It has not been submitted yet.
    </p>
    <p><a href="{{editUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; background: #0b57d0; color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none">Continue your application</a></p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #444">{{editUrl}}</p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #666">
      Not you? Someone with your link can edit this draft — withdraw it from the link above.
      We send this notice at most once an hour.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
